# Paths that never enter the public snapshot (scripts/make-public-snapshot.py, #261).
# Syntax: one glob per line; "dir/" excludes a directory anywhere it matches;
# a pattern without "/" also matches a file name in any directory.
#
# These are safety nets: all of them are untracked in normal use, so a
# snapshot made from tracked files does not contain them anyway. Internal
# operation files that ARE tracked (dev_ops.md, the internal Compose files,
# the release/smoke scripts) are part of the public repository, which is the
# only repository since 2026-10-27. They must therefore be clean, which the
# scan enforces.

# Local deployment folder and older local environment files (hosts, roots, ports).
deploy/local/
deploy/*.local.json
# Local SpecGit declaration and generated agent assets.
.specgit.yaml
.agents/
# Local session snapshots and worktrees.
handoff.md
.claude/worktrees/
# Runtime environment files (.env.example, the published template, does not match).
.env
*.env
